      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "Act 1 — BLUF: four cards",
      "narration_text": "Four cards. Aspect Ratio, which is the shape of the frame. Aesthetics, which is three dials. Model, which is quality and one switch worth knowing. And More Options, which holds speed, privacy, and two settings that only apply to video. Everything here has a sensible default already set. You are adjusting, not configuring.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "estimated_duration_s": 21,
      "shot": {
        "type": "REMOTION",
        "show": [
          {
