    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "Act 4 — Weirdness and Variety",
      "narration_text": "The other two both start at zero. Weirdness pushes towards the unconventional. Variety decides how different the four results are from each other, from zero to one hundred, and the documentation warns that higher values stray further from what you asked for. Move one at a time. If you move all three you will not know which one did it.",
