      "narration_text": "The Model card has three things. Standard or HD, which is quality against time. A version dropdown, which this series deliberately leaves alone. And Raw. Raw is the one worth knowing: it tells Midjourney to hold back its house style and follow your words more literally. If your prompt is detailed and the result keeps looking prettier than you asked for, try Raw.",
