      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "Act 6 — Speed and Stealth",
      "narration_text": "More Options starts with two that apply to everything. Speed is Relax or Fast, and it opens Relax. Fast spends your allowance quicker to get results sooner. Stealth is On or Off, and it opens Off. Off means what you make is visible. On the shared account that matters, because everything you generate sits in a library the rest of the team can see.",
